<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5756/5790.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5756/5790.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5756/5790 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Friday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Saturday will be 5773.</p>
<p>On Thursday the bid/offer rates were 5756/5790, with the official dollar rate 5773 from Friday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
